NEW Impact “Event Arch”.<br></span></p><p data-pf-type="Paragraph2" class="sc-pkvvt cbrLgP pf-48641048"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-0fbcbaf6"><span style="font-weight: bold;">Features:</span><br></span></p><ul data-pf-type="List" class="sc-pcLhl bMMcvF pf-e2434825" style="--text-indent:0; --line-spacing:10px;"><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-oUnPI iVVzrr pf-41d6e3df"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-a2d66f42">Unique design and shape creates maximum visibility<br></span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-oUnPI iVVzrr pf-e3dfb465"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-39fd2ac8">Large Printable areas with flexibility to easily change marketing message<br></span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-oUnPI iVVzrr pf-b465daba"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-cf7f36e4">A patented connector-system allows for fast and easy installation<br></span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-oUnPI iVVzrr pf-dabae243"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-a58441d6">Compact packaging (3 roller bags) allows for no-hassle transportation<br></span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-oUnPI iVVzrr pf-39d4b9de"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-0ba639d4">NO airblowers necessary due to stable ALUMINIUM construction<br></span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-oUnPI iVVzrr pf-d493aa4c"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-0661d493">Arch legs are individually adjustable in stability<br></span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-oUnPI iVVzrr pf-f9a8336f"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-d887f9a8">Add lights for nighttime visibility*<br></span></li></ul><p data-pf-type="Paragraph2" class="sc-pkvvt cbrLgP pf-0bad7c44"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-baf67e35"><span style="font-weight: bold;">THE IMPACT MARQUEE TENT IS DESIGNED WITH DURABILITY, EFFICIENCY, PORTABILITY AND STYLE IN MIND. <br></span>Our built to last original design requires 50% fewer components to build, making it easy to maintain for years of use. It is a versatile structure, offering a wide range of sizes and shapes starting from 10′ Square to an impressive 40′ Hexagon<br><br>Maximize your exposure at your next event with a custom marquee.<br><br><span style="font-weight: bold;">All Impact Marquees can be customized to fit your needs.<br><br></span>Our in-house printing along with our seamless wrap printing solutions allows for an uninterrupted representation of your corporate image. Add in walls, windows, half walls to make a statement at your next event.<br><br><span style="font-weight: bold;">THE IMPACT SPIDER CANOPY PROVIDES MAXIMUM VISIBILITY. <br></span><br>Perfect for large outdoor events!<br></span></p><p data-pf-type="Paragraph2" class="sc-pkvvt cbrLgP pf-af0f191e"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-8281af0f"><span style="font-weight: bold;">Features:</span><br></span></p><ul data-pf-type="List" class="sc-pcLhl bMMcvF pf-3b153b82" style="--text-indent:0; --line-spacing:10px;"><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-oUnPI iVVzrr pf-fb93d10c"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-463210dd">Unique design and shape creates maximum visibility<br></span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-oUnPI iVVzrr pf-d10c67a7"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-8e58df4c">Large printable areas to include your marketing message<br></span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-oUnPI iVVzrr pf-67a7c4d5"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-61321cb4">Stable Aluminum construction<br></span></li></ul></div></div><div class="sc-pJipy mZVAk pf-4d7a16bb accordion__item" data-pf-type="Accordion2.Content.Wrapper"><button type="button" class="sc-pBlxj gYSgcm pf-05e9fa1f pf-bg-lazy accordion__header pf-anchor" data-header-id="e9fa1fde-aec2-48b7-8ff8-a794e09d25a7" data-action="accordion2" data-preopen="false" data-active="false" d